# Weapons that burn, freeze and shock (effects.c), with violence_update on, in the temple square (3005), away from
# Hassan. Each hit with such a weapon can blind (fire), chill (cold) or daze (shock) the victim, unless they save,
# and toasts what they carry: potions, scrolls, wands, staves, pills, drink containers, jewellery and containers
# (whose contents spill to the floor), each by its own chance.
# - Heroic (51) wields a small sword made flaming, frost and shocking (values 1 2 4 1 67), set to level 40 by
#   Smokegod (60), against a pet dragon (350), which picks up one of each
# - a second dragon wields such a sword at level 10 against Decimus (10), who picks up the same
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3005
